    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "By Advs.M/S.Santhosh P.Poduval And R.Rajitha\n This Matrimonial Appeal having come up for Orders on 30.09.2024\nalong with Mat.Appeal 992, 996 and 1047 of 2019, the court on the same day\npassed the following:\n P.T.O.\n Devan Ramachandran & M.B. Snehalatha, Jj.\n ==============================\n Mat. Appeal Nos.965, 992, 996 and 1047 of 2019\n ==========================\n Dated this the 30th day of September, 2024\n Order",
