      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "1 Dr.Nevin C.G. is present before us, while Smt.Reshma K.R. is not, and her learned counsel explains that she has been unable to because of her bereavement in her family.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1490,
      "end": 1661,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Nevin C.G.",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1496,
          "end": 1506
        },
        {
          "text": "Reshma K.R.",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1539,
          "end": 1550
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "As we have already indicated in our order dated 30.08.2024, Smt.Reshma K.R. is agreeable to give up all her claims against Dr.Nevin C.G; but the latter takes the stand before us that he requires some portion of his claim to be honoured.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1662,
      "end": 1899,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "30.08.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1711,
          "end": 1721
        },
        {
          "text": "Reshma K.R.",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1727,
          "end": 1738
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevin C.G",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1789,
          "end": 1798
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Obviously, the parties will have to think about this and we, therefore, accede to the request of their learned counsel to give them one more chance.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1900,
      "end": 2049,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "In the order dated 30.08.2024, Section 498A of the Indian Penal Code is mistakenly shown as 419A.\nWe, therefore, direct the Registry to correct the aforesaid mistake as per usual procedure.\nList, therefore, on 07.10.2024 but we clarify that the parties need not be present and that we will go by versions to be given to Mat. Appeal Nos.965, 992, 996 and 1047 of 2019 us by the learned counsel.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2050,
      "end": 2444,
